<title>SRI LANKA: WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</title>
<headline>WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Thursday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    1.3</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     0.6</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   1.0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		4.5</p>
<p>    Norton		    0.5</p>
<p>    Polgolla		  0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0.5</p>
<p>    Ukowela		   0</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>    Haldummulla	    55.8</p>
<p>The department forecast thundershowers at a few places in the Central, Uva, Western, Southern and Sabaragamuwa provinces for Friday.</p>
